Seerr is an open-source media request and discovery manager for Jellyfin,
Plex, and Emby.  It integrates with Sonarr and Radarr, offers user
management and a customizable request workflow, and serves a web UI
(default port 5055) backed by SQLite or PostgreSQL.

Seerr is a community continuation of Overseerr/Jellyseerr.
